# rank_std: Compute the standard deviation of card ranks in the hand.

# Usefulness: Rank variability is highly relevant for distinguishing between poker hands. High variability is associated with Nothing in hand or Straight, while lower variability can indicate One Pair, Three of a Kind, or Four of a Kind. This captures the dispersion of ranks better than range alone.
end

